{'symbol': 'SHW', 'date': '2022-02-16 12:38:00', 'title': 'SHERWIN-WILLIAMS DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $0.60 PER COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, FEB. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE SHERWIN-WILLIAMS COMPANY (NYSE: SHW) TODAY ANNOUNCED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.60 PER COMMON SHARE, AN INCREASE OF 9.1% OVER THE $0.55 PAID IN THE SAME QUARTER IN 2021, PAYABLE ON MARCH 11, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022. THIS INCREASE FOLLOWS 43 CONSECUTIVE YEARS OF DIVIDEND INCREASES.'}